{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">PAGE statement</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310230","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PAGE-statement.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/PAGE-statement.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"PAGE-statement\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">PAGE statement</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Starts a new output page for PAGED output.\nNo action is taken if output is already positioned at the beginning\nof a page. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PAGE-statement__syntax_GC19ZP2699227\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d137585e106\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PAGE-statement__idGDN2PR2673960\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>PAGE <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> STREAM <var class=\"keyword varname\">stream</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">|</strong> STREAM-HANDLE <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">STREAM <var class=\"keyword varname\">stream</var></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">Specifies the name of a stream where output is paged. If you\ndo not name a stream, the AVM uses the unnamed stream.</dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">STREAM-HANDLE <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var></dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">Specifies the handle to a stream where output is paged. If <var class=\"keyword varname\">handle</var> it\nis not a valid handle to a stream, the AVM generates a run-time\nerror. Note that stream handles are not valid for the unnamed stream.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PAGE-statement__example_GC19ZQ2699240\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d137585e174\">Example</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">This\nprocedure prints a customer report, categorized by state, and starts\na new page for each state:</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <strong class=\"ph b\">r-page.p</strong>\n      </p>\n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"PAGE-statement__idGDN2PS2673969\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>DEFINE VARIABLE laststate AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.\n\nOUTPUT TO PRINTER.\nFOR EACH Customer NO-LOCK BY Customer.State:\n  IF Customer.State &lt;&gt; laststate THEN DO:\n    IF laststate &lt;&gt; &quot;&quot; THEN <strong class=\"ph b\">PAGE.</strong>    laststate = Customer.State.\n  END.\n  DISPLAY Customer.CustNum Customer.Name Customer.Address Customer.City Customer.State.\nEND.</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PAGE-statement__notes_GC19ZR2699246\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d137585e212\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">If\nthe current output destination is not a paged device (you did not\nuse the PAGED option in the OUTPUT TO statement), the PAGE statement\nhas no effect.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">PAGE has no effect if you are already at the top of a new page.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">If any PAGE-TOP or PAGE-BOTTOM frames are active, they are output\nprior to the next display.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">For more information on streams and stream handles, see the\nchapter on alternate I/O sources in <cite class=\"cite\">OpenEdge Development:\nProgramming Interfaces</cite>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"PAGE-statement__see-also_GC19ZS2699252\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d137585e236\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINE-STREAM-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINE-STREAM-statement.html\">DEFINE STREAM statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"OUTPUT-TO-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OUTPUT-TO-statement.html\">OUTPUT TO statement</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Stream-object-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Stream-object-handle.html\">Stream object handle</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"OVERLAY-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/OVERLAY-statement.html\">OVERLAY statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"PAGE-NUMBER-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PAGE-NUMBER-function.html\">PAGE-NUMBER function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310230","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"PAGE statement","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/PAGE-statement.html","type":"Manual"}